{"connection_id": "BC-6192bab170e4a6ade61c", "ref": "Wisdom of Solomon 3:4", "target": "sec2", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "hope of immortality", "note": "The commentary calls the hereafter more abiding; Wisdom says the righteous may seem to die but their hope is full of immortality, explaining how apparent loss can conceal a lasting good."}
